<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING GOALSCORERS IN SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING GOALSCORERS IN SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1996-09-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the</p>
<p>Scottish premier division after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>6 - Pierre Van Hooydonk (Celtic), Billy Dodds (Aberdeen)</p>
<p>4 - Jorge Cadete (Celtic), Ally McCoist (Rangers),</p>
<p>Peter Van Vossen (Rangers), Dean Windass (Aberdeen),</p>
<p>Paul Gascoigne (Rangers), Andreas Thom (Celtic)</p>
